sion/cache leakage bug between workspace instances or consumer accounts was reported on GitHub, garnering 14 comments and attention from Hacker News.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type bugfix\">Bugfix</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/74066\">GitHub</a>\n                        <span>2026-07-04</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\" id=\"insights\">\n                <div class=\"section-title\">\n                    Technical Insights\n                    <span class=\"section-count\">1</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"insight-notice\">\n                    <div class=\"insight-notice-title\">⚠️ Research Limitation Notice</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-notice-content\">\n                        Unable to gather insights from 2026-06-29 to 2026-07-06 due to web search tool rate limits. All search and web reading tools exhausted until 2026-07-09 11:47:49.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">limitation</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">rate-limit</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">research-tools</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <footer>\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"footer-content\">\n                <div>\n                    Report generated by Agent Code Daily - Powered by Claude Agent SDK\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"footer-links\">\n                    <a href=\"https://github.com\">GitHub</a>\n                    <a href=\"/about\">About</a>\n                    <a href=\"/archive\">Archive</a>